  "slug": "rolling-number",
  "title": "Rolling number",
  "group": "Data display",
  "order": 14,
  "summary": {
    "en": "A number whose digits each slide to their new value on the smooth spring, like an odometer. For a count that changes while the person watches.",
    "id": "Angka yang setiap digitnya bergeser ke nilai barunya dengan spring yang halus, seperti odometer. Untuk hitungan yang berubah saat orang sedang melihatnya."
  },
  "titleId": "Rolling number",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Queue numbers taken",
        "desc": "Queue tickets taken today at a district service counter. Each digit slides to its new place. Press the buttons.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-row\" style=\"gap: 20px;\">\n  <span style=\"font: 600 40px/1 var(--font); letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: var(--text-strong);\"><span class=\"roll\" id=\"rn\" role=\"img\" data-lds-roll=\"128\"></span></span>\n  <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" onclick=\"const el = document.getElementById('rn'); import('../../js/lds.js').then((m) => m.setRoll(el, Number(el.getAttribute('aria-label')) + 1));\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">add</span>One more</button>\n  <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" onclick=\"const el = document.getElementById('rn'); import('../../js/lds.js').then((m) => m.setRoll(el, Number(el.getAttribute('aria-label')) + 47));\">Add 47</button>\n</div>",
        "code": "<span class=\"roll\" role=\"img\" data-lds-roll=\"128\"></span>\n<script type=\"module\">\n  import { setRoll } from 'lampung-design-system/js';\n  setRoll(document.querySelector('.roll'), 129);\n</script>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Inside a control",
        "desc": "The like button rolls its count; the stepper rolls its value.",
        "html": "<button class=\"like\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-lds-like aria-label=\"Like\"><span class=\"like__heart\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">favorite</span></span><span class=\"roll\" data-lds-roll=\"24\"></span></button>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Nomor antrean terambil",
        "desc": "Tiket antrean yang terambil hari ini di loket layanan kecamatan. Setiap digit bergeser ke tempat barunya. Tekan tombolnya.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-row\" style=\"gap: 20px;\">\n  <span style=\"font: 600 40px/1 var(--font); letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: var(--text-strong);\"><span class=\"roll\" id=\"rn\" role=\"img\" data-lds-roll=\"128\"></span></span>\n  <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" onclick=\"const el = document.getElementById('rn'); import('../../js/lds.js').then((m) => m.setRoll(el, Number(el.getAttribute('aria-label')) + 1));\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">add</span>Tambah satu</button>\n  <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" onclick=\"const el = document.getElementById('rn'); import('../../js/lds.js').then((m) => m.setRoll(el, Number(el.getAttribute('aria-label')) + 47));\">Tambah 47</button>\n</div>",
        "code": "<span class=\"roll\" role=\"img\" data-lds-roll=\"128\"></span>\n<script type=\"module\">\n  import { setRoll } from 'lampung-design-system/js';\n  setRoll(document.querySelector('.roll'), 129);\n</script>"
